8ab8c769-b754-4aa4-a776-f9c37ceb1afb	ocds-b5fd17-59d97901-1a09-4912-ac73-cf5a87318d96	Invitation to Tender: Tree Equity & Urban Resilience Project	Trees for Cities is delighted to support the Mayor of London's new London Tree Equity and Urban Resilience (TE&UR) project, a scheme initiated by the Greater London Authority (GLA) to improve access to trees, and the benefits they provide, within London neighbourhoods facing high heat risk and wider social vulnerability. \r\nAs part of our role in this project, we are inviting bids from suitably qualified consultants to support delivery TE&UR initiative.  \r\n\r\nTrees for Cities is acting as the contracting authority for this commission and will oversee delivery of the consultant's work as part of the wider TE&UR partnership. See link for more details Learn more about Trees for Cities' work and organisational strategy.  \r\n\r\nThis Invitation to Tender (ITT) is for a time-limited commission to deliver treescape enhancement opportunity mapping, ground-truthing and investment planning for 15 ward-scale areas distributed across a cohort of six London boroughs (e.g. 1 to 3 ward(s) per borough).  \r\n\r\nFurther background on the TE&UR initiative and the associated partnership is provided in section 1.1.2 and 1.2.3 of the Specification Schedule.   \r\n\r\nFurther details on the ambitions, anticipated outcomes and outputs expected from this commission are detailed in section 1.2 \r\n\r\nThis project requires a range of skills and we welcome consortia, with a single lead consultant required. Further details are provided on consultant capabilities and available data input in section 1.3.  \r\n\r\nAppointment is anticipated in August 2026 with delivery commencement expected by the end of the month, and payment to be made following achievement of key project milestones, as set out in the timetables provided in section 1.4. \r\n\r\nTo download the response documents, and for the links to ask questions and to submit applications, please visit our website at https://www.treesforcities.org/invitation-to-tender-tree-equity-urban-resilience-project	\N	4f67edf4-4ad9-493b-935c-87bc5b9fdde0	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	254000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/8c6bd6b6-2bb7-4f16-bea0-a0d9d61b0bd9	\N	\N	\N	{"Engineering-related scientific and technical services",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-08-04	2026-06-30	14a5e5845d3eea971ea6e346c67d841b76a47a642f58d3e62b0abc7d61e414f7	'/invitation-to-tender-tree-equity-urban-resilience-project':304B '1':166B '1.1.2':188B '1.2':212B '1.2.3':190B '1.3':243B '1.4':280B '15':152B '2026':249B '3':168B 'access':42B 'achiev':266B 'across':158B 'act':87B 'ambit':199B 'anticip':200B,246B 'applic':296B 'appoint':244B 'area':156B 'ask':291B 'associ':182B 'august':248B 'author':38B,91B 'avail':238B 'background':174B 'benefit':47B 'bid':72B 'borough':164B,172B 'capabl':236B 'citi':11B,85B,122B 'cohort':160B 'commenc':252B 'commiss':94B,138B,207B 'consortia':223B 'consult':76B,101B,228B,235B 'contract':90B,313C 'data':239B 'delight':13B 'deliv':140B 'deliveri':79B,98B,251B 'detail':116B,196B,209B,231B 'distribut':157B 'document':285B 'download':282B 'e.g':165B 'end':256B 'engin':306C 'engineering-rel':305C 'enhanc':142B 'equiti':5A,24B 'expect':204B,253B 'face':53B 'finder':314C 'follow':265B 'gla':39B 'greater':36B 'ground':146B 'ground-truth':145B 'heat':55B 'high':54B 'improv':41B 'initi':33B,82B,179B 'input':240B 'invest':149B 'invit':1A,71B,128B 'itt':131B 'key':268B 'lead':227B 'learn':117B 'limit':137B 'link':113B,289B 'london':19B,22B,37B,51B,163B 'made':264B 'map':144B 'mayor':17B 'mileston':270B 'month':259B 'neighbourhood':52B 'new':21B 'opportun':143B 'organis':125B 'outcom':201B 'output':203B 'overse':97B 'part':62B,105B 'partnership':111B,183B 'payment':261B 'per':171B 'plan':150B 'pleas':297B 'project':8A,30B,68B,214B,269B 'provid':49B,185B,233B,277B 'qualifi':75B 'question':292B 'rang':217B 're