ec19e886-5250-4e05-a914-fe53f5e54ae8	ocds-b5fd17-1c5ddefe-3190-4397-8b3d-0ec94889b4e6	The Jobs Guarantee - RFP	Fedcap is exploring the opportunity to deliver the National Jobs Guarantee Scheme Grant released by the Department for Work and Pensions (DWP).\r\nThe Jobs Guarantee is a national employment programme designed to support young people aged 18-24 who have been unemployed and claiming Universal Credit for 18 months or more. It aims to break the cycle of long-term unemployment by offering every eligible participant a guaranteed, fully funded six month paid job, alongside tailored support to help them succeed and progress.\r\n\r\nDelivered by specialist Delivery Partners, the programme focuses on an employment-first approach, where young people move quickly into real jobs rather than extended pre-employment training. Partners work closely with local employers to source suitable roles -funded for up to 25 hours per week at the relevant minimum wage - and match participants based on their skills, interests, and needs.	\N	ce4cba8d-c798-4311-9ff9-328e3a6c9d62	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	1	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/79a70e13-efad-498e-b38a-bd4338e9ec5a	\N	\N	\N	{"Education and training services",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-06-22	2026-06-12	cc09263bee17b27a60b463639c78155f275863f8710ed42cabd0e2f8ffbac6ba	'-24':42B '18':41B,52B '25':132B 'age':40B 'aim':57B 'alongsid':80B 'approach':102B 'base':144B 'break':59B 'claim':48B 'close':120B 'contract':156C 'credit':50B 'cycl':61B 'deliv':11B,89B 'deliveri':92B 'depart':21B 'design':35B 'dwp':26B 'educ':151C 'elig':70B 'employ':33B,100B,116B,123B 'employment-first':99B 'everi':69B 'explor':7B 'extend':113B 'fedcap':5B 'finder':157C 'first':101B 'focus':96B 'fulli':74B 'fund':75B,128B 'grant':17B 'guarante':3A,15B,29B,73B 'help':84B 'hour':133B 'interest':148B 'job':2A,14B,28B,79B,110B 'local':122B 'long':64B 'long-term':63B 'match':142B 'minimum':