1df516e3-e81e-4bf7-99f3-2ced6834af92	ocds-b5fd17-caf640d6-4219-4f2e-b6ed-b219f7b9899f	CA18050 - R9321	The Trust is seeking to appoint a suitably qualified and experienced contractor to undertake waterproofing and refurbishment works to the A2 Theatre Roof and B7 Plant Room at St Helier Hospital. The works include roof preparation and repairs, application of a liquid waterproofing membrane system, parapet and flashing repairs, drainage improvements, replacement fire-rated external doors, refurbishment of roof safety railings, and waterproof tanking of the B7 plant room floor. The works shall be undertaken within a live healthcare environment and include provision of all associated access, health and safety measures, infection prevention controls, testing, certification, warranties and handover documentation\r\n\r\nTo access this competition: \r\n\r\nRegistered:\r\nLogin to https://suppliers.multiquote.com and view the opportunity CA18050.\r\n\r\nNot registered:\r\nVisit https://suppliers.multiquote.com then register and quote CA18050 as the reason for registration. \r\n\r\n Any queries please contact MultiQuote on 020 3920 8054.	\N	faff1f7f-9f80-465d-88d4-8fa9b9abeaca	3bb6f9ba-8232-43e4-aa98-adacde651c03	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	300000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/4dfaa0c8-fa15-4db5-b9ab-d6bf10682fea	\N	\N	\N	{"Construction work",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-07-10	2026-06-12	3babe308e463c969ef9efb02b04bdb9c6edd37e1f7c32841d4bdd4f150cbb68a	'020':137B '3920':138B '8054':139B 'a2':23B 'access':90B,105B 'applic':41B 'appoint':8B 'associ':89B 'b7':27B,70B 'ca18050':1A,116B,125B 'certif':99B 'competit':107B 'construct':140C 'contact':134B 'contract':143C 'contractor':14B 'control':97B 'document':103B 'door':59B 'drainag':52B 'environ':83B 'experienc':13B 'extern':58B 'finder':144C 'fire':56B 'fire-r':55B 'flash':50B 'floor':73B 'handov':102B 'health':91B 'healthcar':82B 'helier':32B 'hospit':33B 'i