75999425-4907-4eb9-820b-df60bd2573ed	ocds-b5fd17-a11f8690-fa0f-4cee-a256-2010582dfb19	DHSC: Knowledge Sharing (Blueprinting and Optimisation)	The National Blueprinting Programme is a cornerstone initiative supporting digital transformation across the NHS. Established to systematically capture, codify, and share best practice in digital innovation, the programme provides a national framework that enables health and care organisations to learn\r\nfrom proven digital exemplars and apply these insights within their own local contexts. By doing so, Blueprinting helps NHS organisations support their digital maturity, optimise the value of digital investments, and deliver improved outcomes for both patients and staff\r\n\r\nAdditional information: \r\nTo express interest and participate in the tender, please register and apply via Atamis e-sourcing portal https://health-family.force.com/s/Welcome.\r\n\r\nShould Tenderers have any queries, or having problems using the portal, they should contact Helpdesk at:\r\n\r\nPhone: 0800 9956035\r\n\r\nE-mail: support-health@atamis.co.uk	\N	75af7cd3-9834-483b-9081-c63a64dbea3f	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	1200000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/bfe0c140-0add-433f-975e-d5bb14e54524	\N	\N	\N	{"Digital offset equipments",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-04-26	2026-06-04	37edf748e419591247057508e79aa2a7fba34fac7c4e08e0b9f75e15d49a8032	'/s/welcome.':108B '0800':126B '9956035':127B 'across':18B 'addit':86B 'appli':52B,99B 'atami':101B 'best':28B 'blueprint':4A,9B,63B 'captur':24B 'care':43B 'codifi':25B 'contact':122B 'context':59B 'contract':136C 'cornerston':13B 'deliv':78B 'dhsc':1A 'digit':16B,31B,49B,69B,75B,132C 'e':103B,129B 'e-mail':128B 'e-sourc':102B 'enabl':40B 'equip':134C 'establish':21B 'exemplar':50B 'express':89B 'finder':137C 'framework':38B 'health':41B 'health-family.force.com':107B 'health-family.force.com/s/welcome.':106B 'help':64B 'helpdesk':123B 'imp