ee289c96-f64d-439e-ba95-a7634941d577	ocds-b5fd17-51ee687c-9f26-4990-a4d9-e8b6c9f58c23	Invitation to Tender - Group learning module on urban nature finance	CONTEXT\r\nNature Towns and Cities is a growing coalition, united by a shared mission to create greener, healthier and more resilient towns, cities and neighbourhoods and for millions more people to have access to nature close to home, no matter where they live. \r\n\r\nTHE COMMISSION\r\nAs part of this programme, we are developing a group learning offer for programme participants - primarily local authority practitioners, but also place-based partnerships of NGOs, community organisations and others. The group leaning should help them to unlock new funding and finance for urban nature - benefitting people, place and nature. \r\nWe are looking for an external consultant, or consortium to develop and deliver a group learning course on funding and finance for urban nature, including but not limited to repayable investment and developing new funding models.  \r\n\r\nBUDGET\r\nWe have a maximum of £20,000 (inc. VAT) for this work.\r\n\r\nINFO TO BE RETURNED\r\nSubmissions should include the following information: \r\n•\tOutline of your proposed approach to the project, including details of how you would approach developing and delivering the course. \r\n•\tDescription of your relevant experience and abridged CVs of the proposed project team. \r\n•\tProposed budget breakdown. \r\n•\tDetails of any matters or concerns not covered by this brief.  \r\n\r\nSubmissions should be no more than 10 pages in length. Abridged CVs can be included as appendices.  \r\nThese should be returned to anne.mackinnon@nationaltrust.org.uk by the deadline of 5pm, Friday 31st July 2026. \r\n\r\nPlease see the attached Invite to Tender document for full details.	\N	4ba03a4e-d8b4-44f9-b632-a04a9a9ecc7f	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	20000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/15f6d