aae7d080-eaae-4db9-bb5e-af95826bc36a	ocds-b5fd17-ac4cd947-135a-4699-9db7-164ebc1a24c3	Opportunity to Tender - Topo - Regional Framework Lots (England) - J. Murphy & Sons	J. Murphy & Sons invites expressions of interest from experienced civil engineering subcontractors for inclusion on a framework of regional lots across England, supporting major infrastructure programmes.\r\nThe framework will provide call off opportunities aligned to regional delivery teams and project locations.\r\n\r\nProject Portfolio Includes:\r\nNetwork Rail CP7\r\nTransPennine Route Upgrade (TRU)\r\nPeel Ports\r\nOther rail and infrastructure projects across England\r\n\r\nScope of Services:\r\nThe framework will cover the provision of topographical and surveying services, including:\r\nTopographical & Site Surveys\r\nTopographical surveying of sites, corridors and infrastructure assets\r\nDetailed mapping of natural and built features, including levels, contours and surface features\r\n\r\nUtility & Desktop Surveys\r\nDesktop utility surveys and statutory records searches\r\nIdentification and interpretation of underground services data\r\n\r\nRail & Infrastructure Surveys\r\nPWAY (Permanent Way) surveys\r\nStructure and track monitoring, including deformation and movement surveys\r\n\r\nSurvey Control\r\nEstablishment and maintenance of permanent survey control grids and benchmarks\r\n\r\nLaser Scanning & Advanced Data Capture\r\nTerrestrial laser scanning (LiDAR)\r\nHigh definition (HD) video survey capture\r\n3D point cloud data generation and reality capture\r\n\r\nAerial & Remote Surveys\r\nManned aerial surveys, including:\r\nLiDAR\r\nPhotogrammetry\r\nHD video surveys\r\nUnmanned Aerial Systems (UAS) / drone surveys\r\n\r\nMonitoring & Measurement\r\nAsset, structure and track monitoring\r\nInstallation and repeat surveys to track movement or changes over time\r\n\r\nData Processing & Delivery\r\nProcessing and interpretation of all survey data\r\nProduction of outputs in CAD, BIM and GIS formats\r\nDelivery of drawings, models, reports and digital datasets\r\nQuality assurance and validation of survey outputs\r\n\r\nHow to Apply:\r\nSuppliers must express interest through CompeteFor to receive further tender information, including lot structure and next steps.\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout the buyer's selection process:\r\nRegional Approach:\r\nThe framework will be structured into regional lots across England, allowing suppliers to bid for one or multiple regions based on:\r\n\r\nSurvey capability and specialist technology\r\nAvailability of equipment and skilled personnel\r\nLocal presence and mobilisation times\r\nCapacity to deliver multiple, concurrent survey commissions"\r\nSuitable Suppliers\r\nThis opportunity is aimed at suppliers who demonstrate:\r\n\r\nProven experience in topographical and infrastructure surveying, including rail environments\r\nCapability across traditional and advanced survey techniques (laser scanning, aerial surveys, digital capture)\r\nExperience delivering surveys in live, constrained or high risk environments\r\nStrong health, safety, environmental and quality performance\r\nAbility to produce accurate, high quality digital survey outputs aligned to industry standards\r\nSMEs and regional surveying providers are encouraged to apply	\N	c298cefe-d98e-43a7-b9a2-0c900da44efb	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	1000000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/fbd7827c-48d8-4a55-a293-31585bd3289f	\N	\N	\N	{"Civil engineering support services",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-07-21	2026-07-21	846feed5631296687951d46d660af0e711e504573ac868b6304878a8b67b46e3	'3d':171B 'abil':371B 'accur':374B 'across':32B,70B,285B,342B 'advanc':158B,345B 'aerial':179B,183B,192B,350B 'aim':326B 'align':45B,380B 'allow':287B 'appli':251B,392B 'approach':276B 'asset':97B,199B 'assur':243B 'avail':303B 'base':296B 'benchmark':155B 'bid':290B 'bim':230B 'built':103B 'buyer':271B 'cad':229B 'call':42B 