t boxes, fencing, habitat creation)\r\nPost construction monitoring and reporting\r\n\r\nEnvironmental Compliance & Advice\r\nAdvice to ensure compliance with wildlife legislation and planning conditions\r\nSupport for environmental permitting and stakeholder engagement\r\nInput into construction planning to manage ecological risks\r\n\r\nData Management & Reporting\r\nCollection, analysis and interpretation of ecological data\r\nPreparation of technical reports, licence documentation and compliance records\r\nDelivery of outputs aligned to planning authority and regulatory requirements\r\n\r\nHow to Apply:\r\nSuppliers must express interest through CompeteFor to receive further tender information, including lot structure and next steps.	\N	c298cefe-d98e-43a7-b9a2-0c900da44efb	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	1000000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/a49efac8-af91-45f7-9d2c-9499ee11c263	\N	\N	\N	{"Civil engineering support services",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-07-21	2026-07-21	07a9bfaa7989250a58f797f98c03ef89413761800e7bdd34730d34566d006f65	'accord':140B,200B 'across':32B,70B 'advic':237B,238B 'align':45B,285B 'analysi':267B 'appli':294B 'applic':149B 'apprais':92B 'appropri':136B 'assess':89B,113B,119B 'author':288B 'badger':108B 'bat':104B,225B 'biodivers':115B 'bird':110B 'bng':118B 'box':226B 'brief':189B 'call':42B 'cieem':142B 'civil':21B,312C 'classif':97B 'clearanc':168B,175B,197B 'clerk':181B 'collect':266B 'compens':211B 'competefor':300B 'complianc':165B,192B,236B,241B,280B 'condit':160B,247B 'constraint':203B 'construct':231B,257B 'contract':317C 'cover':78B 'cp7':58B 'creation':229B 'crest':106B 'data':263B,272B 'deliveri':48B,126B,282B 'document':278B 'e.g':98B,103B,150B,179B,224B 'ecia':114B 'ecolog':4A,82B,87B,91B,111B,124B,169B,171B,180B,202B,208B,222B,261B,271B 'ecologist':138B 'ecow':184B 'engag':254B 'engin':22B,313C 'england':8A,33B,71B,152B 'ensur':191B,240B 'environment':84B,19