d45ab4f4-2c4f-49d4-9c27-05f6ee8d0fa1	ocds-b5fd17-31c8c335-731a-492c-bccb-ce335f43660d	Somersham Parish Council external lift project	Somersham Parish Council invites tenders from suitably qualified and experienced contractors for the design, supply, installation and commissioning of an external passenger lift at the Parish Council office. \r\nThis will be accessed via an existing changing room, adapted for such use.\r\n\r\nThe project aims to improve accessibility to the building for all users, ensuring safe and independent access for wheelchair users, people with reduced mobility, parents with pushchairs and other visitors.\r\n The installation should support the Council's commitment to providing inclusive and accessible public services.\r\n\r\nThe successful contractor will provide a complete turnkey solution, including:\r\n\r\nSite survey and design.\r\nSupply and installation of an external passenger lift.\r\nAny associated structural, electrical and building works.\r\nAlterations to the existing building as required \r\n(Note: preparatory building work to be undertaken by a separate contractor.)\r\nTesting, commissioning and certification.\r\nUser training, operation manuals and warranty documentation.\r\n\r\nThe lift must comply with all relevant legislation and current standards, including the Equality Act 2010, Building Regulations, and applicable British Standards for passenger lifts.\r\n\r\nTenders should demonstrate relevant experience of delivering similar accessibility projects and provide details of proposed timescales, costs, warranties and maintenance arrangements.\r\nTender submissions should include:\r\n\r\nCompany profile and relevant experience.\r\nDetails of similar projects completed within the last five years.\r\nProposed lift manufacturer and model.\r\nOutline design proposal.\r\nProgramme of works, including anticipated project duration.\r\nBreakdown of costs.\r\nDetails of warranties and maintenance packages.\r\nEvidence of relevant insurance.\r\nHealth and Safety policy.\r\nRisk assessment methodology.\r\nReferences from comparable public sector or community projects.\r\n\r\nThe Council requires prospective contractors to undertake a site visit prior to submitting a tender.\r\n\r\nApproximate platform size is 1100 x 1480 mm with two stops located at the Norwood Building, Somersham.\r\n\r\n\r\nApply to\r\nThe Executive Officer\r\nSomersham Parish Council\r\nThe Norwood Building\r\nParkhall Road,\r\nPE28 3HE	\N	7eb8e35e-99c4-4112-90a1-b0383f8ae39e	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	40000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/24b3a9a6-bb5b-403f-ab6d-11fbe91c0091	\N	\N	\N	{"Installation services of electrical and mechanical equipment",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-08-24	2026-07-14	97dd07d6e7b4316f5c1426571ac8ef2b395fcc8f580e87ab781addac6577b936	'1100':278B '1480':280B '2010':166B '3he':305B 'access':38B,53B,64B,90B,184B 'act':165B 'adapt':44B 'aim':50B 'alter':122B 'anticip':228B 'appli':291B 'applic':170B 'approxim':274B 'arrang':196B 'assess':249B 'associ':116B 'breakdown':231B 'british':171B 'build':56B,120B,126B,131B,167B,289B,301B 'certif':143B 'chang':42B 'commiss':24B,141B 'commit':85B 'communiti':257B 'compani':201B 'compar':253B 'complet':99B,210B 'compli':154B 'contract':314C 'contractor':17B,95B,139B,263B 'cost':192B,233B 'council':3A,9B,33B,83B,260B,298B 'current':160B 'deliv':182B 'demonstr':178B 'design':20B,106B,222B 'detail':188B,206B,234B 'document':150B 'durat':230B 'electr':118B,309C 'ensur':60B 'equal':164B 'equip':312C 'evid':240B 'execut':294B 'exist':41B,125B 'experi':180B,205B 'experienc':16B 'extern':4A,27B,112B 'finder':315C 'five':214B 'health':244B 'improv':52B 'includ':102B,162B,200B,227B 'inclus':88B 'independ':63B 'instal':22B,79B,109B,306C 'insur':243B 'invit':10B 'last':213B 'legisl':158B 'lift':5A,29B,114B,152B,175B,217B 'locat':285B 'mainten':195B,238B 'manual':147B 'manufactur':218B 'mechan':311C 'methodolog':2