b490dbf9-57c0-4569-856b-7c53b0f2e08c	ocds-b5fd17-ea04fdeb-1dde-434b-8ff4-51985e987a2b	Procurement of ventilated diving equipment and mobile hyperbaric chamber	Chemonics Group UK Ltd invites tenders for the procurement of ventilated diving equipment and a mobile hyperbaric decompression chamber for delivery in Ukraine under the Partnership Fund for a Resilient Ukraine Phase 2 (PFRU-2).\r\n\r\nThe procurement is divided into two lots:\r\n• Lot 1: Mobile hyperbaric decompression chamber  \r\n• Lot 2: Ventilated diving equipment and associated systems  \r\n\r\nTenderers may submit offers for one or both lots.\r\n\r\nDelivery will be to Chernihiv Region, Ukraine. The exact delivery address will be provided to the successful Tenderer at contract award stage. Delivery shall be on a DDP basis (Incoterms 2020), and must be completed within a maximum of 8 weeks from receipt of Purchase Order.\r\n\r\nThe contract will be awarded using a pass/fail technical assessment. Among technically compliant tenders, award will be made to the tenderer offering the lowest total evaluated price, in line with the Most Economically Advantageous Tender (MEAT) principle.\r\n\r\nFull technical specifications, requirements, and submission instructions are provided in the Invitation to Tender (ITT) and associated attachments.\r\n\r\nHow to apply:\r\nTenders must be submitted electronically to: PMU-UKR-PFRU@chemonics.com\r\n\r\nTechnical and Financial proposals must be submitted separately in accordance with the ITT instructions.\r\n\r\nThe deadline for submission is 20 July 2026 at 17:00 (UK time).\r\n\r\nThe contract value is not disclosed. Suppliers should refer to the ITT documentation for full details.	\N	5cbb1e9d-3c13-4a06-90e6-6489de48f97f	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	1	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/3c8be511-8048-44cf-a62f-df8037541a07	\N	\N	\N	{"Diving instruments or accessories",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-07-20	2026