 initial deadline. Unite Procurement UK Limited reserves the right to review and onboard new suppliers on a rolling basis to meet evolving requirements and to maintain a dynamic and responsive supplier network.\r\n\r\nFor any enquiries and interest, please email defence.support@unite.eu with the subject title TSS 681 Opportunity.	\N	a72f0b4c-4bdd-4e23-b0c2-07114b402f0b	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	100000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/68b46c70-3f36-457d-bb47-c98f3bb42b97	\N	\N	\N	{"Electronic equipment",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-08-05	2026-07-08	b8e1a9d0a9deee9e5904f2b0610850b152d376215f35ebbea44cf0d827950688	'681':323B 'aid':81B 'also':102B 'ancillari':3A,40B 'appli':157B 'applic':263B 'appoint':208B 'associ':62B,244B 'base':233B 'basi':296B 'behalf':20B,116B 'beyond':276B 'cabl':5A,42B 'calibr':53B 'capabl':72B,178B 'choic':237B 'close':256B 'competit':231B 'compliant':137B 'connector':9A,46B 'consider':261B 'contact':165B 'contain':93B,99B 'conting':75B 'contract':328C 'cover':49B 'cutter':7A,44B 'date':257B 'deadlin':279B 'defenc':25B,121B,242B 'defence.support@unite.eu':317B 'detail':172B 'disabl':71B 'divers':229B 'dynam':305B 'earli':260B 'electron':325C 'email':316B 'emerg':70B 'encourag':248B 'enquiri':312B 'ensur':227B,259B 'eod':82B 'equip':63B,326C 'evolv':299B 'express':197B,250B 'finder':329C 'fire':59B,86B 'flexibl':235B 'general':74B 'high':152B 'high-volum':151B 'hold':17B,113B 'hous':95B 'howev':262B 'includ':4A,41B,103B 'inform':183B 'initi':278B 'instead':215B 'intend':206B 'interest':158B,163B,199B,252B,314B 'join':30B,126B,265B 'lead':6A,43B 'limit':13B,109B,169B,203B,283B 'low':149B 'low-valu':148B 'maintain':303B 'mainten':52B,180B 'manag':147B 'market':140B 'may':218B 'mean':84B 'meet':298B 'ministri':23B,119B,240B 'modif':177B 'multipl':216B 'need':87B 'network':309B 'new':291B 'offer':135B 'onboard':186B,220B,290B 'oper':76B 'opportun':324B 'organis':145B,245B 'ove