baf8d1ea-2e95-4d4f-b880-be42815a7aac	ocds-b5fd17-64b0da6b-4488-43a2-ad30-aafaee557915	Adult Education and Training Dynamic Purchasing Vehicle	The London Borough of Camden ('the Authority') are reopening the Adult Education and Training Dynamic Purchasing Vehicle for new applicants for Lot 2: Programmes that promote employment in the Health and Social Care Sector, Hospitality and Retail, Construction/Green Skills and STEAM (Scientific, Technical, Engineering, Arts and Medical) ONLY.\r\n\r\nAdult Community Learning and the Inclusive Economy services provide education and learning for adults.\r\n\r\nThe Adult Community Learning Services provide learning opportunities that meet the needs of learners over the age of 19 in Camden. The mission is to encourage and support adults to make their steps back into learning and so become more active economically, in their families and communities, and maintain better health.\r\nThe services commissioned will offer learning in a wide variety of community venues and/or online to engage adult learners from very diverse communities.\r\n\r\nThe Inclusive Economy service takes a human-centred, collaborative approach to developing innovative solutions that help all residents and businesses thrive. The team works with key stakeholders to ensure that Camden is the best place to do business and to work and that Camden's citizens are well placed to access the job opportunities that central London offers. The service will provide opportunities to deliver employment support for adults in line with this approach. \r\n\r\nhttps://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/faaced49-b084-49e7-a886-a9d1991a964c	\N	f775f21d-4170-4330-b716-d3dd477f9557	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	\N	\N	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/96535b39-db8e-48d5-8881-ef994f0a985b	\N	\N	\N	{"Education and training services",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-07-13	2026-07-02	42bd966c37eec966067c7ddb2583ada1d207337884