ey must be submitted via the In-Tend System.\r\n\r\nYour tender response must also be submitted through In-Tend to arrive by the date and time specified. Late tenders will not be considered.	\N	f4c745c0-30b4-48c4-8379-40ad2304cdc3	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	60000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/36c2eec9-db4a-46e8-a687-3eb115a726fc	\N	\N	\N	{"Health services",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-06-25	2026-05-28	702a3791bc88204e9e4542485b18d1edcf00b88cf8f94c71a7213f674b8566f1	'/sheffield':276B '1':172B,194B '2':196B,235B,241B '2023':31B '4':161B '4961/ps/lwm':1A,8B '6':184B 'access':132B 'act':30B,47B,106B 'advertis':58B 'agreement':166B 'also':303B 'appoint':157B 'appropri':208B 'arriv':311B 'author':23B 'avoid':95B 'basi':56B,82B 'case':53B,55B 'cdp':67B 'central':64B 'comment':283B 'communiti':152B 'compli':88B 'consid':323B 'contact':130B 'contract':22B,61B,232B,327C 'counsel':116B,222B 'date':314B 'de':206B 'de-escal':205B 'defin':49B,108B 'digit':65B 'discharg':212B 'discret':72B 'document':254B 'doubt':97B 'download':265B 'e':271B 'e-tend':270B 'ensur':198B 'escal':203B,207B 'exercis':260B 'finder':328C 'follow':170B 'framework':165B 'health':115B,137B,221B,324C 'hour':195B 'impli':85B 'in-tend':295B,307B 'in-tendhost.co.uk':275B 'in-tendhost.co.uk/sheffield':274B 'increment':246B 'initi':228B 'intend':155B 'itt':262B 'late':318B 'legisl':92B 'manag':201B 'maximum':159B,193B 'measur':216B 'mental':114B,136B,220B 'model':186B 'must':290B,302B 'oblig':86B 'offer':121B 'onlin':5A,12B,175B 'open':258B 'oper':43B 'otherwis':57B 'outcom':215B 'perform':250B 'platform':66B 'point':128B 'potenti':239B 'process':252B 'procur':29B,46B,91B,99B,105B 'provid':168B,174B,211B 'psycholog':139B,176B 'purpos':26B 'question':281B 'rang':134B 'relat':285B 'reserv':34B 'respons':301B 'right':36B 'risk':199B 'routin':210B 'servic':120B,141B,171B,226B,325C 'session':7A,14B,185B,189B 'sheffield':18B,113B,147B 'singl':1