c343229b-7308-48e7-9c6d-b3d918ca916b	ocds-b5fd17-5d1df5bb-c622-42d6-a972-18412ac48f4a	Residential and Nursing Care Home Services	Staffordshire County Council (the Council) has put in place a Dynamic Purchasing System (DPS) arrangement for the provision of residential and nursing care home services for its clients. \r\n\r\nThe Council has received applications to join the DPS from providers registered with the Care Quality Commission and has entered into a DPS Agreement for the provision of Residential and Nursing Care Home Services (the DPS Agreement) with each of the successful applicants in respect of one or more of ten lots.  The DPS arrangement will remain open up to 30 September 2019 with an option to extend and the Council will continue to receive and consider applications to join the DPS until such closing date.   \r\n\r\nThe DPS is split into the ten (10) lots described below:\r\n\r\nLot: 1:  Residential - Older People\r\nLot 2:  Residential - Dementia\r\nLot 3:  Residential - Physical Disability / Sensory Impairment\r\nLot 4:  Residential - Learning Disability / Autistic Spectrum Disorder\r\nLot 5:  Residential - Mental Health\r\nLot 6:  Nursing - Older People\r\nLot 7:  Nursing - Dementia\r\nLot 8:  Nursing - Physical Disability / Sensory Impairment\r\nLot 9:  Nursing - Learning Disability / Autistic Spectrum Disorder\r\nLot 10: Nursing - Mental Health\r\n\r\nInvitations to Tender for Call Off Contracts under the DPS Agreement commenced on 11 December 2017.\r\n\r\nThis Contract Award Notice relates to Call Off Contracts which have been awarded under the DPS Agreement with effect from 11 September 2025 to 10 December 2025 (inclusive).\r\n\r\nAdditional information: The Council has decided to exercise its option under clause 2.3 of the DPS Contract to further extend the Contract Period in accordance with the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (as amended from time to time).\r\n\r\nThe Council has extended the Contract Period from 30 September 2025 up until, and including, 31 March 2029.	\N	bd918a62-509a-4f6f-897c-7407e9e76682	f1db683a-6ce7-43ab-89de-e726c2f33641	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	274810000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/69d8e998-8b9c-4fbc-bc55-9f119c595135	\N	\N	\N	{"Health and social work services",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2017-07-14	2026-05-19	ce8a9803b841a20cd4ca01945b51825e377c75ff7f42ecbf080ef8916ed7a5fb	'1':133B '10':128B,186B,230B '11':203B,226B '2':138B '2.3':246B '2015':264B '2017':205B '2019':97B '2025':228B,232B,281B '2029':288B '3':142B '30':95B,279B '31':286B '4':149B '5':157B '6':162B '7':167B '8':171B '9':178B 'accord':258B 'addit':234B 'agreement':58B,71B,200B,222B 'amend':266B 'applic':39B,77B,112B 'arrang':21B,89B 'autist':153B,182B 'award':208B,218B 'call':194B,212B 'care':4A,29B,49B,66B 'claus':245B 'client':34B 'close':119B 'commenc':201B 'commiss':51B 'consid':111B 'continu':107B 'contract':196B,207B,214B,250B,255B,262B,276B,295C 'council':9B,11B,36B,105B,237B,272B 'counti':8B 'date':120B 'decemb':204B,231B 'decid':239B 'dementia':140B,169B 'describ':130B 'disabl':145B,152B,174B,181B 'disord':155B,184B 'dps':20B,43B,57B,70B,88B,116B,122B,199B,221B,249B 'dynam':17B 'effect':224B 'enter':54B 'exercis':241B 'extend':102B,253B,274B 'finder':296C 'health':160B,189B,289C 'home':5A,30B,67B 'impair':147B,176B 'includ':285B 'inclus':233B 'inform':235B 'invit':190B 'join':41B,114B 'learn':151B,180B 'lot':86B,129B,132B,137B,141B,148B,156B,161B,166B,170B,177B,185B 'march':287B 'mental':159B,188B 'notic':209B 'nurs':3A,28B,65B,163B,168B,172B,179B,187B 'older':135B,164B 'one':81B 'open':92B 'option':100B,243B 'peopl':136B,165B 'period':256B,277B 'physic':144B,173B 'place':15B 'provid':45B 'provis':24B,61B 'public':261B 'purchas':18B 'put':13B 'qualiti':50B 'receiv':38B,109B 'regist':46B 'regul':263B 'relat':210B 'remain':91B 'residenti':1A,26B,63B,134B,139B,143B,150B,158B 'respect':79B 'sensori':146B,175B 'septemb':96B,227B,280B 'ser