e14ad31a-0bcb-4900-a68f-4cd286015dd7	ocds-b5fd17-d6349353-d1b7-45dd-ac76-e2f42c407ad0	Acacia centre roof overlay works	Works comprise the emergency roofing works to address historic water ingress issues at Acacia Centre, Mitcham. This largely includes overlaying the roof with a new plywood deck to allow a new continuous high performance liquid system to be applied inclusive of PIR insulation to meet current Building Regulations. The centre has various end users such as a Nursery, community groups, local midwifery team and social services. The Contractor will be expected to closely liaise with the centre manager and Caretaker on a daily basis to ensure disruption to services is kept to a minimum.\r\nNature: Works are in response to historic rainwater ingress issues since the building was constructed in 2012 as part of a GLA grant. The building which is constructed from modular units, provides a mixture of facilities for the end-user in terms of a Nursery, office facilities and social services.\r\n\r\nPlease note: All correspondence, queries and submission of tenders must be done via the London Tenders Portal.	\N	25fa09db-1a23-43c3-94b7-8f3e39e4d113	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	320000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/377194e1-4e94-4871-8397-4cdbd2c5931f	\N	\N	\N	{"Construction work",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-06-08	2026-05-18	828fe8924247e144693fc24491c806b4fed4829691e8d6629cd92a92bc17da03	'2012':116B 'acacia':1A,19B 'address':13B 'allow':34B 'appli':44B 'basi':89B 'build':52B,112B,124B 'caretak':85B 'centr':2A,20B,55B,82B 'close':78B 'communiti':64B 'compris':7B 'construct':114B,127B,168C 'continu':37B 'contract':171C 'contractor':73B 'correspond':154B 'current':51B 'daili':88B 'deck':32B 'disrupt':92B 'done':162B 'emerg':9B 'end':58B,139B 'end-us':138B 'ensur':91B 'expect':76B 'facil':135B,147B 'finder':172C 'gla':121B 'grant':122B 'group':65B 'high':38B 'histor':14B,106B 'includ':24B 'inclus':