 extensometers\r\n      \r\n      Provision of Maintenance Team\r\n      •\tCommence September 2026, end December 2036 (maybe extended.\r\n      •\tProvision of maintenance services to ensure operation of installed instrumentation, maintaining solar and battery powered equipment.\r\n      •\tUndertaking manual monitoring where necessary\r\n\r\nAdditional information: It will be beneficial for you to describe your business as mush as possible and highlight where you can help us to achieve our values described above	\N	18b8f616-a754-4724-aaa0-7a3724ffe57e	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	40000000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/17bb5818-d6ec-4a70-96f9-1dab83a6538d	\N	\N	\N	{"Instrumentation and control equipment",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-05-08	2026-04-29	1b25186e70bdba33f35aafa2a3d107c973506b2e38022cdcb898db7eea60e93c	'1':117B,154B '2':119B,156B '200nr':132B,170B '2026':125B,161B,238B '2027':128B,188B,191B,214B '2028':164B '2029':217B '2036':112B,241B '50nr':197B '55m':139B 'achiev':289B 'acquisit':26B 'addit':265B 'analysi':102B 'approx':131B 'area':76B,88B,110B 'b':91B,106B 'backfil':210B 'batteri':56B,257B 'benefici':270B 'borehol':134B 'busi':276B 'c':94B,109B 'cell':229B 'client':33B 'commenc':123B,159B,186B,212B,236B 'commiss':15B 'complianc':60B 'consid':72B 'contract':298C 'control':295C 'cover':86B 'coverag':100B 'data':25B,84B 'databas':35B,49B 'decemb':190B,240B 'depth':137B 'describ':274B,292B 'direct':99B 'drill':129B 'end':126B,162B,189B,215B,239B 'ensur':249B 'equip':259B,296C 'expect':53B 'extend':115B,243B 'extensomet':231B 'finder':299C 'follow':78B 'former':168B,195B 'gaug':177B,204B 'gnss':149B,179B,206B 'ground':17B,20B,141B 'ground-wat':19B 'help':286B 'highlight':282B 'histor':83B 'horizont':225B 'hydraul':227B 'inclinometers/saa':226B 'includ':11B,45B 'industri':63B 'inform':266B 'insar':79B 'instal':13B,133B,143B,165B,172B,192B,199B,218B,223B,252B 'instrument':1A,23B,51B,2