cf6c4694-ff5c-463c-81ca-0af8dbedb6bd	ocds-b5fd17-c6b3a62c-9c26-4df2-8cba-d85edf42f44d	RA357798 - Provision of Diesel Shredder	We shall be publishing a tender for the provision of a Diesel Shredder via the Delta e-sourcing platform. We are aiming to publish this on the 14/05/2026.\r\n\r\nThe purpose of this advert is market reach to attract interested parties to be invited to participate in the tender process. \r\n\r\nPlease review the below spec and confirm interest to lewis.atkinson@londonenergyltd.com\r\n\r\n**SPEC**\r\nType - Mobile diesel-powered shredder for bulky waste\r\n\r\nApplication - Suitable for processing a wide range of materials including wood, plastics and municipal solid waste.\r\nEngine specification;\r\nEngine Type- Diesel engine 403 CAT C15\r\nDouble hydrostatic transmission\r\nPower output - 403 bkW/540 BHP or better\r\nEmission Standard - Meets EU stage V or EPA Tier 4 standards\r\nFuel Tank capacity - At least 600 Liters\r\nCEM (Clean air module)\r\nNoise level measurement (according to ISO standards)\r\n-\tSound power level - 110 dB(A) L Db or better\r\n-\tSound Pressure Level 88 Db (A) L or better\r\nFuel consumption - Approximately 25 liters/hour under full load or better\r\nShredding chamber/hopper\r\n-\tWith 8-knife cutting table\r\n-\tLoading height of hooper  - 3505mm or better\r\n-\tBelt conveyor- 10250mm Length x 1200mm Width\r\n-\tParker P30 pumps\r\n-\tHagguland CB280 or better\r\n-\t2 shafts\r\n-\tCutting area 2420x 2000\r\n-\tWeight 15 tonnes or better\r\n-\tAt least 12 cutting knives\r\n-\tHousehold waste up to 100 tonnes per hour or better\r\n-\tBulky waste up to 50 per hour or better\r\n-Radio remote controlled\r\n\r\n - To access this competition: login to https://suppliers.multiquote.com and view the opportunity RA357798. Not registered on MultiQuote - visit https://suppliers.multiquote.com then register and quote RA357798 as the reason for registration. Any queries please contact MultiQuote on 0151 482 9230.	\N	4bc093fc-23b