cc6df345-ef81-48b4-a02f-5ed6050aa1f8	ocds-b5fd17-1e666f2c-45a9-4370-9457-4bcaabdf8d14	Supply of Defence Specialist Equipment	Unite Procurement UK Limited (part of Unite Holding SE), on behalf of the Ministry of Defence, is seeking suppliers to join the Unite Procurement Platform to support the Supply of Defence Specialist Equipment \r\nThe procurement covers;\r\n\r\n1. Crimping Tools \r\nA specialist handheld crimping tool for use in EOD, demolition, and military engineering roles. The tool is a multi-function device designed for use with Initiated Set Field Engineering (ISFE) components, flash detonators, safety fuze, and detonator cord. Key capabilities include:\r\n•\tCrimping of ISFE and flash detonators to safety fuze or detonator cord\r\n•\tIntegrated firing cable cutting capability\r\n•\tIntegrated firing cable stripping capability\r\n•\tScrewdriver functionality incorporated into the tool design\r\n•\tRectifier functionality incorporated into the tool design\r\n•\tRobust, portable, and suitable for operational field use in austere environments\r\n\r\n2. Injector Stands\r\nA specialist injector stands for use with in-service EOD disruptor systems. The stand is designed to support rapid deployment and stable operation of disruptors in the field.\r\nKey Functional Requirements:\r\n•\tCompatible with all current UK in-service disruptor systems (Note: the Needle disruptor is specifically excluded from compatibility requirements)\r\n•\tProvides stable and adjustable support for disruptor positioning during EOD operations\r\n•\tSuitable for use across varied terrain and operational environments\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Unite Procurement Platform\r\n(Unite | Simplify indirect procurement with our smarter platform) offers a compliant route to market for UK Public Sector organisations to manage low-value, high-volume procurement.\r\n\r\nHow to Apply\r\nInterested suppliers should register their interest by contacting Unite Procurement UK Limited and provide details of their product range, modification capabilities, and maintenance services. Further information on the onboarding process for the Unite Procurement Platform will be provided upon expression of interest and can also be found at the link attached.\r\n\r\nUnite Procurement UK Limited does not intend to appoint a sole supplier for this requirement. Instead, multiple suppliers may be onboarded to the Unite Procurement Platform to ensure a diverse and competitive supply base, supporting flexibility and choice for the Ministry of Defence and associated organisations.\r\n\r\nSuppliers are encouraged to express their interest by the stated closing date to ensure early consideration. However, applications to join the Unite Procurement Platform will be welcome at any time beyond the initial deadline. Unite Procurement UK Limited reserves the right to review and onboard new suppliers on a rolling basis to meet evolving requirements and to maintain a dynamic and responsive supplier network.\r\n\r\nFor any enquiries an interest, please email defence.support@unite.eu with the subject title ''TSS 636 Opportunity''	\N	a72f0b4c-4bdd-4e23-b0c2-07114b402f0b	\N	b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002	United Kingdom	\N	2500000	GBP	Public Tender	Open	\N	https://www.contractsfinder.service.gov.uk/Notice/4412f6d0-7c3a-415e-8894-faa069287f04	\N	\N	\N	{"Individual equipment",UK,"Contracts Finder"}	2026-05-11	2026-04-27	9a95053e626fbdcd528a15d07000c180da4793947598ebde2ff899227226bb0a	'1':42B '2':134B '636':418B 'across':203B 'adjust':192B 'also':288B 'appli':243B 'applic':358B 'appoint':303B 'associ':339B 'attach':294B 'auster':132B 'base':328B 'basi':391B 'behalf':16B 'beyond':371B 'cabl':101B,106B 'capabl':85B,103B,108B,264B 'choic':332B 'close':351B 'compat':169B,187B 'competit':326B 'compliant':223B 'compon':76B 'consider':356B 'contact':251B 'contract':423C 'cord':83B,98B 'cover':41B 'crimp':43B,48B,87B 'current':172B 'cut':102B 'date':352B 'deadlin':374B 'defenc':3A,21B,36B,337B 'defence.support@un